        {"source_time": "01:20:04.47", "original_excerpt": "you were going to start a company"},
        {"source_time": "01:19:56.67-01:20:08.39", "original_excerpt": "would you do it again?"},
        {"source_time": "01:20:08.39", "original_excerpt": "I wouldn't do it"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "section_title": "比想象中难一百万倍",
      "frame": "frames/02.png",
      "frame_time": "01:20:37.71",
      "focus_x": 0.46,
      "source_time": "01:20:11.59-01:20:31.39",
      "lines": ["原因其实很简单", "创办并建设英伟达", "比我预想中难了一百万倍", "也超出了我们所有人的想象"],
      "line_sources": [
        {"source_time": "01:20:11.59", "original_excerpt": "The reason for that is really quite simple"},
        {"source_time": "01:20:23.99", "original_excerpt": "building a company and building NVIDIA"},
        {"source_time": "01:20:26.39", "original_excerpt": "turned out to be a million times harder than I expected"},
        {"source_time": "01:20:28.11-01:20:31.39", "original_excerpt": "than any of us expected"}
      ]
